WEBVTT

00:11:28.809 --> 00:11:32.187
To become a stranger
in your own land again.

00:11:33.313 --> 00:11:37.151
So however much you might
hate that experience,

00:11:37.192 --> 00:11:40.612
however much you might be scared
by that culture shock,

00:11:40.612 --> 00:11:43.031
the lesson from anthropology is this.

00:11:44.032 --> 00:11:46.452
Don't run away from culture shock.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.204
Seize it as an opportunity.

00:11:49.997 --> 00:11:56.003
Recognize that lockdown has kept us all
trapped with our own tribe, physically.

00:11:56.044 --> 00:11:57.588
Our own "pod."

00:11:58.046 --> 00:12:00.507
We've gone online into echo chambers.